BADCHAR = Character is invalid here.
BADEXPR = Expression is invalid.
EXPECTED_PROCEDURE = CALL requires a procedure name.
EXTRANEOUS = Unexpected extra input.
FACTORY_RETURN_TYPE_NOT_ALLOWED = FACTORY definitions cannot specify a return type.
FUNCTION_NOT_FOUND = Function was not found.
INVALID_ARG_OPTION = ARG option is invalid.
INVALID_ARG_SYNTAX = ARG intrinsic has invalid syntax.
