LEGACY_ARG_STEM_SYNTAX = ARG stem syntax has been removed; use arg[] or arg[n].
INVALID_DECIMAL_CASE_VALUE = NUMERIC CASE value is invalid.
INVALID_DECIMAL_DIGITS_RANGE = NUMERIC DIGITS value is outside the supported range.
INVALID_DECIMAL_FORM_VALUE = NUMERIC FORM value is invalid.
INVALID_DECIMAL_FUZZ_RANGE = NUMERIC FUZZ value is outside the supported range.
INVALID_DECIMAL_STANDARD_VALUE = NUMERIC STANDARD value is invalid.
INVALID_ARGEXISTS_SYNTAX = ARGEXISTS intrinsic has invalid syntax.
INVALID_INITIALIZED_SYNTAX = INITIALIZED intrinsic has invalid syntax.
INVALID_IN_ARRAY_DEF = Stem variables are not valid in array definitions.
INVALID_SIZEOF_SYNTAX = SIZEOF intrinsic has invalid syntax.
INTRINSIC_GENERIC_TYPES_UNSUPPORTED = Intrinsic type parameter lists are not supported in Release 1.
INVALID_LHS = Assignment target is invalid.
INVALID_NUMERIC_OPTION = NUMERIC option is invalid.
INVALID_REFVALID_SYNTAX = REFVALID intrinsic has invalid syntax.
INVALID_TYPEOF_SYNTAX = TYPEOF intrinsic has invalid syntax.
LEGACY_REFVALID_SYNTAX = REFVALID call syntax has been removed; use <refvalid>(expr).
LEGACY_TYPEOF_SYNTAX = TYPEOF call syntax has been removed; use <typeof>(expr).
KEYWORD = Reserved keyword cannot be used here.
MISSING_OPTIONS = OPTIONS instruction is required at the start of the source.
MISSING_TYPE = Type is required.
MISSING_WHEN = SELECT requires a WHEN clause.
MUST_EQUAL_TYPE = Ellipsis arguments must specify a type.
NOT_A_FUNCTION = Symbol is not a function.
OPTIONAL_ELLIPSIS = OPTIONAL cannot be combined with an ellipsis argument.
SIGNAL_CANNOT_BE_RAISED = This signal cannot be raised.
SIGNAL_FACTORY_BAD_SHAPE = SIGNAL factory call has invalid syntax.
SIGNAL_FACTORY_REQUIRES_NAME = SIGNAL factory call requires a signal name.
SIGNAL_HANDLER_BAD_SIGNATURE = Signal handler must accept the signal context and return a signal result.
SIGNAL_HANDLER_NOT_FOUND = Signal handler was not found.
SIGNAL_OFF_REQUIRES_SIGNAL_NAME = SIGNAL OFF requires at least one signal name.
SIGNAL_ON_REQUIRES_CALL = SIGNAL ON requires CALL.
SIGNAL_ON_REQUIRES_HANDLER = SIGNAL ON CALL requires a handler name.
SIGNAL_ON_REQUIRES_SIGNAL_NAME = SIGNAL ON CALL requires at least one signal name.
SIGNAL_REQUIRES_OPERAND = SIGNAL requires ON, OFF, or a condition.
TRACE_ADD_REQUIRES_SUPPRESSED = TRACE ADD requires SUPPRESSED.
TRACE_NAMESPACE_CONTROL_HAS_NO_OUTPUT = TRACE namespace control does not produce output.
TRACE_NAMESPACE_REQUIRES_NAME = TRACE NAMESPACE requires a name.
TRACE_OUTPUT_REQUIRES_TARGET = TRACE OUTPUT requires a target.
TRACE_REMOVE_REQUIRES_SUPPRESSED = TRACE REMOVE requires SUPPRESSED.
TRACE_REQUIRES_OPTION = TRACE requires an option.
TRACE_RESET_REQUIRES_NAMESPACES = TRACE RESET requires NAMESPACE or NAMESPACES.
TRACE_SUPPRESS_REQUIRES_NAMESPACE = TRACE SUPPRESS requires a namespace name.
TRACE_UNKNOWN_OPTION = TRACE option is not known.
TRACE_UNEXPECTED_OPERAND = TRACE has an unexpected operand.
TRACE_UNSUPPRESS_REQUIRES_NAMESPACE = TRACE UNSUPPRESS requires a namespace name.
TRACE_VALUE_REQUIRES_EXPRESSION = TRACE VALUE requires an expression.
UNKNOWN_DIAGNOSTIC = Unknown diagnostic.
UNKNOWN_NAMED_OPERATOR = Unknown named operator.

